{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4028490/extras/7b4d3fa2b80f386ccebdf23ca037d711.poster.avif?t=1773938907\" width=832 height=448 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4028490/extras/7b4d3fa2b80f386ccebdf23ca037d711.webm?t=1773938907\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4028490/extras/7b4d3fa2b80f386ccebdf23ca037d711.mp4?t=1773938907\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Old School Tiny 3D Platformer</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Super Candle World is a 3D-Platformer and Collect-a-Thon, in a colorful cartoon look, but with an old school gameplay. The Candle King wants you to gather all golden cookies for him, so go on an adventure, explore colorful islands, discover marvelous secrets in this short game inspired by classics, like Super Mario 64 or Astrobot!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4028490/extras/deb700b3ed877ef7aabf602851f4b9a7.poster.avif?t=1773938907\" width=892 height=286 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4028490/extras/deb700b3ed877ef7aabf602851f4b9a7.webm?t=1773938907\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4028490/extras/deb700b3ed877ef7aabf602851f4b9a7.mp4?t=1773938907\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Features:</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A colorful world to explore\u00a0\ud83c\udfdd\ufe0f</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Candle can jump, fly, attack and run everywhere!\u00a0</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Big world, small levels, it's quick, it's fun, it's simple</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A short adventure that can be finished in 1 hours for the price of a coffee\u00a0\u2615</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Feature a cute candle and a birthday cake!\u00a0\ud83c\udf82</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4028490/extras/8c4d3b315e9b4f402a2e61bffe762a8a.poster.avif?t=1773938907\" width=832 height=448 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4028490/extras/8c4d3b315e9b4f402a2e61bffe762a8a.webm?t=1773938907\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4028490/extras/8c4d3b315e9b4f402a2e61bffe762a8a.mp4?t=1773938907\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >About the creator</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >My name is Fran\u00e7ois Mauxion, and I'ma solo dev creating small games of any kind. From 2D action platformer to 3D old school collectathon! I do everything by myself, except for some musics, My goal is to offer quick and simple fun with my games, so I hope you'll like this one!</p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/4028490?t=1773938907","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4028490/81d16a6c18357ccdbef4f7858ed71c461e7bb8ae/page_bg_raw.jpg?t=1773938907","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4028490/53fb9de95f99c418fb63e1d22e206cb701291b77/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1773938907","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4028490/53fb9de95f99c418fb63e1d22e206cb701291b77/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=